{"id":"9b3f9185-d433-471f-a932-4d81ca5dec3e","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"0759e4d1463c0905","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workers/node-worker.ts","baseline":{"blob":"485b9b1f68417d736a74970e4e25949d69aa4b21","start":2002,"end":2018},"shape":{"type":"Expression","atoms":["connectWorkspace"]},"context":{"before":"c8b6fd786247675f","after":"11b1234be4130952"}},"payload":{"text":"(every change a dev server makes goes back as `workspace.changed`: the workbench persists and announces it)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:31.653Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:31.653Z"}
{"id":"c5e5e91e-3dbc-4864-9b99-1b84e745ec5d","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3bb9e33752970844","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workers/node-worker.ts","baseline":{"blob":"76d2f5cde844a321681a94dcbe4bff42926ec4aa","start":0,"end":84},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","ExchangeCall",",","WireResponse","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api/runtime","\""]},"context":{"after":"ee87dd8e99b5a9dc"}},"payload":{"text":"The dev-server worker: almostnode's in-browser Vite dev servers, off the workbench's main thread and in a global of\ntheir own, on the shared workspace filesystem (the buffer arrives over the hub, `workspace.buffer`), so a dev server\nsees exactly the files the editor, the type checker and the debugger do. Started for the first server and never stopped\n(workbench/node-runner.ts), so its servers outlive any run.\n\nIt answers what the service worker relays (`virtual.request`, `/__virtual__/<tab>/<port>/…`) from the dev server on that\nport, or from a debug run that serves it (`virtual.debug.<port>`, editor-api's runtime link), or says nobody's there.\nEvery call of an exchange (a body in pieces) names its port, so each goes where its request went.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:45.619Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:45.619Z"}
{"id":"c653e526-df64-4c93-bce2-28c4d054b385","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f5de72cd92f294af","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workers/node-worker.ts","baseline":{"blob":"cc4d8bff007e7e1df825aac8cc38df2e13abbc4e","start":8342,"end":8633},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["serve","(","hub",",","\"","preview.stops","\"",",","(","raw",")","=>","{","const","{","\"","stops","\"",":","given","}","=","(","raw","??","{","}",")","as","{","\"","stops","\"","?",":","unknown","}",";","stops","=","typeof","given","===","\"","object","\"","&&","given","!==","null","?","given","as","Record","<","string",",","number","[]",">",":","{","}",";","for","(","const","[","port",",","server","]","of","servers",")","{","applyStops","(","port",",","server",")",";","}","return","true",";","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"78a031ff0881b7ff","after":"c7500ce3782380d7"}},"payload":{"text":"The recorded stops, from the editor's breakpoints (extensions/bridge/recorded-stops.ts): every dev server's from now on.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:31:30.256Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:31:30.256Z"}
{"id":"c7b51767-bc6e-44f6-9172-cb86b2fc8f68","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"77f50ce77d478021","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/workers/node-worker.ts","baseline":{"blob":"dc9971779d640af789d6d6e2d7fdf33062fc5f01","start":3521,"end":3565},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","stopped","=","new","Map","<","number",",","DevServer",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"66c6172c239c6230","after":"11574ece5fcfb7bf"}},"payload":{"text":"A stopped dev server, by its port, until another starts there: what its pages ran is read after it stops (their last\nreport comes as its run ends), against the versions it served (`preview.version`).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:13.481Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:32:13.481Z"}
